poser\" OR \"Modelio\") AND (\"electrical power system\" OR \"electrical power systems\" OR \"electric power system\" OR \"electric power systems\" OR \"electrical power subsystem\" OR \"electrical power subsystems\" OR \"electric power subsystem\" OR \"electric power subsystems\" OR \"electrical energy subsystem\" OR \"electrical energy subsystems\" OR \"EPS\" OR \"EPSs\" OR \"power subsystem\" OR \"power subsystems\" OR \"power system\" OR \"power systems\" OR \"spacecraft power system\" OR \"spacecraft power systems\" OR \"power supply\" OR \"power supplies\" OR \"power distribution unit\" OR \"power distribution units\" OR \"PDU\" OR \"PDUs\" OR \"power processing unit\" OR \"power processing units\" OR \"power control and distribution\" OR \"power management and distribution\" OR \"electrical architecture\" OR \"electrical architectures\" OR \"power architecture\" OR \"power architectures\" OR \"DC power bus\" OR \"DC power buses\" OR \"PCDU\" OR \"PCDUs\" OR \"PMAD\" OR \"PMADs\")",
